// Article 1. Creation: the parties and the trust fund.
Fact person Identified by Margaret, Daniel, Anna, Ben
Fact usd Identified by Money(USD, 2)
Var fund Identified by usd
Bool in-force
Fact deceased Identified by person
Event death Related to person Creates deceased(person)

Act settle Actor person Related to usd
  Holds when person == Margaret && Not(in-force())
  Creates in-force(), fund(usd)

Clause 1.1 Approved "be7e6c0e60e0828b820bc3bef28313a3e53da746f72d56149ceb33a040822b1a"
  Norm "Margaret Ellis, the settlor, transfers the trust fund to the trustee to hold in trust." => settle
  Definition " The settlor is the first trustee."
.
